<title>USA: Fritz Cos wins plant management contract.</title>
<headline>Fritz Cos wins plant management contract.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fritz Cos Inc said Monday it has signed a three-year contract to manage Equate Petrochemical Co's global distribution from Kuwait.</p>
<p>Equate is a joint venture between Union Carbide Corp and Petrochemical Industries Co of Kuwait.</p>
<p>The company is in the final stages of completing a U.S. $2.0 billion dollar production plant in Kuwait that will produce polyethylene and ethylene glycol.</p>
<p>Financial details of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
